/// The product experience an organization primarily sees — drives onboarding,
/// terminology, navigation, and dashboard defaults. Deliberately separate from:
///   - `Organization.organizationType` (free-text, user-typed, display-only —
///     never drives behavior; kept as-is, not migrated into this enum)
///   - `OrganizationLabFeature` / Labs enrollment (a technical feature-gate,
///     e.g. PTA's data model being enabled at all — this enum is the
///     product-experience classification, Labs enrollment is one input signal
///     used to backfill it, not the same concept)
///   - subscription tier / optional paid modules (this enum never implies
///     entitlement — see resolveOrganizationExperience)
