/// UNION-WEB-DASH: how an organization's members actually pay dues in the
/// real world. Presentation-only — never drives a payroll integration.
/// Most relevant to Union (employer payroll checkoff is common there), but
/// left generic since any vertical could conceivably collect dues outside
/// Unestra.
enum DuesCollectionMethod {
  /// Dues are deducted from members' paychecks by their employer and
  /// remitted to the union in bulk — Unestra never collects payment
  /// directly from these members. The UI must not show "Pay Dues" as a
  /// primary CTA or imply an owed balance from this alone.
  PAYROLL_DEDUCTION
  /// Members pay dues directly through Unestra (Stripe or recorded manual
  /// payments) — the existing dues/payment UI applies as-is.
  UNESTRA_DIRECT
  /// Dues are collected entirely outside Unestra by some other means
  /// (e.g. a separate billing system) — Unestra is not the source of
  /// truth for payment status.
  EXTERNAL
  /// A mix of the above across the membership — the UI shows whatever is
  /// actually true per member/record rather than a single blanket message.
  MIXED
  /// This organization does not collect dues at all.
  NONE
}

